return ['domain'=>'zinn-translate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-translate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:38:11+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:38:11+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Translate'=>'Zinn® Translate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate','Publishes this site in every language you choose, on its own web addresses, with translated slugs, metadata, menus, WooCommerce products, hreflang, per-language sitemaps and llms.txt. Translate with your Zinn Digital® plan or with your own provider key.'=>'使用您选择的每种语言发布本网站，拥有其独立的网址，并包含已翻译的别名、元数据、菜单、WooCommerce 产品、hreflang、每种语言的站点地图以及 llms.txt。使用您的 Zinn Digital® 方案或您自己的提供商密钥进行翻译。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'已保存。请输入新值进行替换。','Filter this list…'=>'筛选此列表……','Filter this list'=>'筛选此列表','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'没有符合该筛选条件的项。','Add a row'=>'添加行','Remove this row'=>'删除此行','Remove'=>'移除','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — 概览','Overview'=>'概览','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'此网站上的每一个 Zinn® 插件，以及它是否正在运行。','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'此插件无需连接。','Open settings'=>'打开设置','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您没有权限更改这些设置。','Settings sections'=>'设置区块','Support'=>'支持','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Tools'=>'工具','Export settings'=>'导出设置','Reset to defaults'=>'恢复默认设置','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'这会将此插件的所有设置恢复为默认值。是否继续？','Diagnostics for support'=>'支持诊断','Import a settings file'=>'导入设置文件','Import'=>'导入','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'导出的文件中绝不包含密码、令牌或 API 密钥——您需要在新站点上重新输入这些信息。','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'此插件的所有设置已恢复为默认值。','Done.'=>'完成。','That action is not available.'=>'该操作不可用。','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'无法读取该文件。请选择从 Zinn® 插件导出的设置文件。','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'该文件太大，无法作为设置导出。','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'该文件不是 Zinn® 设置导出文件。','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'该文件是从另一个插件 (%s) 导出的，因此在这里导入它将存储该插件无法识别的设置。','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'已导入 %d 个设置。密码和 API 密钥不会包含在导出文件中，请重新输入。','Translate'=>'翻译','Manual overrides'=>'手动覆盖','Sitemaps and URLs'=>'站点地图和网址','General'=>'常规','Who pays for the translation'=>'谁来支付翻译费用','Either your Zinn Digital® plan, or an API key of your own. There is no free tier — somebody pays a provider for every word.'=>'无论是您的 Zinn Digital® 方案，还是您自己的 API 密钥。没有免费层——每个人使用每个字都需要向提供商付费。','My Zinn Digital® plan'=>'我的 Zinn Digital® 方案','My own provider key'=>'我的提供商密钥','Site ID'=>'站点 ID','From your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on this site\'s Translation tab.'=>'从您的 Zinn Digital® 控制面板，在此网站的“翻译”选项卡上。','Site token'=>'站点令牌','Provider'=>'服务商','API key'=>'API 密钥','Your key, billed to you by the provider. It is stored on this site and sent only to them.'=>'您的密钥，由提供商向您收费。它存储在本网站上，且仅发送给他们。','Model'=>'模型','Leave empty for the cheapest model that does the job well.'=>'留空则使用能胜任工作的最便宜模型。','This site is written in'=>'本网站的语言为','Leave empty to use the site language from WordPress settings.'=>'留空则使用 WordPress 设置中的站点语言。','Languages to publish'=>'发布语言','Each one gets its own web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed.'=>'每个站点都有自己的网址和网站地图。只发布您希望被索引的语言。','Translate automatically when I publish or update'=>'发布或更新时自动翻译','Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing.'=>'编辑页面会将其译文标记为过期，系统将在后台重新生成。编辑但不更改任何字词不会消耗任何费用。','What gets translated'=>'翻译内容','Post types'=>'文章类型','Translate the web addresses too'=>'请一并翻译网址','French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks.'=>'法国访客将被引导至 /fr/a-propos/ 而不是 /fr/about/。未翻译的网址将继续有效并进行重定向，因此任何已被索引的内容都不会失效。','Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text'=>'翻译 SEO 标题、描述和图片替代文本','Translate categories and tags'=>'翻译分类和标签','Translate navigation menus'=>'翻译导航菜单','Translate WooCommerce products and attributes'=>'翻译 WooCommerce 产品和属性','Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched.'=>'简短描述、购买备注、属性标签和变体描述。价格、SKU 和存储的选项值绝不会被修改。','SEO'=>'SEO','Add hreflang tags'=>'添加 hreflang 标签','Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it.'=>'告诉搜索引擎这些页面是不同语言的相同页面。除非另一个插件已经在处理此功能，否则请保持开启。','Publish a sitemap for each language'=>'为每种语言发布站点地图','Publish llms.txt for each language'=>'为每种语言发布 llms.txt','A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap.'=>'AI 答案引擎可读取的纯文本网站地图。它们通常无法运行 JavaScript，并且可能永远不会获取站点地图。','Language switcher'=>'语言切换器','Style'=>'样式','Colours, spacing and corners are on the Styling tab. Place it with the block, the [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, or a menu.'=>'颜色、间距和圆角在“样式”选项卡中。将其与区块、[zinn_language_switcher] 简码或菜单一起放置。','Show only these languages'=>'仅显示这些语言','Leave empty to show every language you publish.'=>'留空则显示您发布的所有语言。','Name each language in its own language'=>'用各自的语言显示每种语言的名称','Deutsch rather than German. Somebody who cannot read the current page cannot read "German" either.'=>'Deutsch 而不是 German。无法阅读当前页面的人也无法阅读 "German"。','Show flags'=>'显示标志','Off by default: a language is not a country, and Arabic and Spanish have no single flag that does not exclude most of their speakers.'=>'默认关闭：语言不等于国家，阿拉伯语和西班牙语也没有任何一面国旗能够代表其绝大多数的使用者而不产生排他性。','Include the language being read'=>'包含正在读取的语言','Include the original language'=>'包含原文','Add it to this menu'=>'添加到此菜单','Only the menu you name here. Nothing is added to any other menu on the site.'=>'仅显示您在此处命名的菜单。网站上的任何其他菜单都不会添加任何内容。','Accent'=>'重音符号','Background'=>'背景','Text'=>'文本','Corner radius'=>'圆角半径','Spacing'=>'间距','Text size'=>'文本大小','Do not add it to a menu'=>'不要将其添加到菜单中','Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again.'=>'在这里编辑任何翻译。编辑后的翻译会完全按照您的书写保留，在页面再次翻译时绝不会被覆盖。','Every language'=>'每种语言','Search translations'=>'搜索翻译','Filter'=>'筛选','Content'=>'内容','Language'=>'语言','Translation'=>'翻译','Status'=>'状态','Save'=>'保存','Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background.'=>'尚未进行翻译。发布语言后，翻译将在后台开始。','These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console.'=>'这些地址当前处于活动状态。请打开其中任意一个进行检查，并将站点地图索引提交给 Google Search Console。','You are not allowed to edit translations on this site.'=>'您无权在此网站上编辑翻译。','Edited by you — kept'=>'您已编辑 — 保留','Source changed — will be redone'=>'源已更改 — 将重新生成','Up to date'=>'已是最新版本','Connected'=>'已连接','Connecting…'=>'正在连接……','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'已连接，但有需要注意的问题','Not connected'=>'未连接','Running on your own account'=>'在您自己的账户上运行','We could not check this'=>'我们无法检查此内容','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'此插件未说明原因。请发送诊断报告，我们将进行查看。','Connection status'=>'连接状态','Last checked %s ago.'=>'最后检查于 %s 前。','(opens in a new tab)'=>'（在新标签页中打开）','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'发送至 Zinn® 支持','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'这正是将要发送的内容——没有别的，也没有隐藏内容。您的密码、令牌和 API 密钥均不包含在其中。','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'将发送的诊断报告','Copy to clipboard'=>'复制到剪贴板','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'将此报告发送至 Zinn® 支持团队','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'我们将为您创建一个支持工单并通过电子邮件回复。如果您不想发送，请将其复制并自行粘贴到工单中。','Copied'=>'已复制','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'无法从此服务器 (%s) 连接到 Zinn Digital®。请复制上方的报告并提交工单 —— 您的设置没有任何问题。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® 客服已收到您的报告，并将通过电子邮件回复。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'已收到您的报告 — 编号 %s — Zinn® 支持团队将通过电子邮件回复。','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'您在短时间内发送了多个报告。请稍候几分钟再试——之前的报告已经送达。','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® 刚才无法接受该报告——这是我们这边的问题，而非您的。请稍后重试，或将上面的报告复制到工单中。','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'报告被拒绝 (HTTP %d)。请将其复制并在上方提交工单，附上该编号。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南与服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读 %s 用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® 的 WordPress 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移以及为管理多个网站的人而构建的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖已建成的网站、域名和外链，资金将安全托管，直到双方满意为止。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的人','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们全球的自由职业者市场：浏览