des it.'=>'一个起点。其下的任何内容都会覆盖它。','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'使用我自己的颜色和尺寸','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'不勾选此项，预设将完全按原样使用。','Zinn® language switcher'=>'Zinn® 语言切换器','Let visitors read this page in another language.'=>'让访客以其他语言阅读此页面。','Title'=>'标题','Use the plugin setting'=>'使用插件设置','Dropdown'=>'下拉菜单','Inline list'=>'内联列表','Pills'=>'药丸','Minimal text'=>'极简文本','Flags and names'=>'标记与名称','Stacked list'=>'堆叠列表','Choose a language'=>'选择语言','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'请参阅 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'已下载的更新未能通过完整性检查，因此未进行安装。','No DeepL API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'未保存 DeepL API 密钥，因此无法进行翻译。','DeepL does not translate into %s. Choose Google Gemini or OpenAI for this language, or connect the site to Zinn Digital®.'=>'DeepL 不支持翻译为 %s。请为此语言选择 Google Gemini 或 OpenAI，或将网站连接至 Zinn Digital®。','DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'无法连接到 DeepL。未进行任何翻译，也未收取任何费用；系统将在下次运行时重试。','Your DeepL character quota is used up for this period. Translation resumes when it resets, or when you raise the limit on your DeepL account.'=>'您的 DeepL 字符配额在此期间已用完。配额重置或您在 DeepL 账户中提高额度后，翻译将恢复。','DeepL answered with something we could not read. Nothing was saved.'=>'DeepL 返回了无法读取的内容。未保存任何内容。','No Google Gemini API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'未保存任何 Google Gemini API 密钥，因此无法进行翻译。','Google Gemini could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'无法连接到 Google Gemini。未进行任何翻译，也未产生任何费用；系统将在下一轮重试。','No OpenAI API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'未保存 OpenAI API 密钥，因此无法进行翻译。','OpenAI could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'无法连接到 OpenAI。未进行翻译，也未产生任何费用；系统将在下一次重试。','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®, so there is nothing to collect. Add the Site ID and token, or switch to your own provider key.'=>'此网站未连接至 Zinn Digital®，因此无可收集的内容。请添加网站 ID 和令牌，或切换至您自己的提供商密钥。','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'本网站与 Zinn Digital® 无关。','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Nothing was sent; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Zinn Digital® 无法访问。未发送任何内容；将在下一轮尝试中重试。','Translation is paused on this site. Check the account is up to date on your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'此网站的翻译已暂停。请在您的 Zinn Digital® 仪表板上检查账户是否已结清。','Zinn Digital® rejected this site\'s token. Copy it again from the site\'s Translation tab on your dashboard.'=>'Zinn Digital® 拒绝了此网站的令牌。请从您仪表板上的网站“翻译”选项卡中重新复制。','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'无法连接到 Zinn Digital®。您的网站将继续提供其现有的翻译。','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® 的响应无法读取。您的网站将继续提供现有的翻译。']];